=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c0bcc11050fe0d238536a2ceeb3e6598 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3bc94a4a/uploads/origins/8638f23b-66c1-4910-a3ac-78ced9749708?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3336bf15dbf00aed44802c2512901056 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Dear Sir/ Madam,\n\nI would like you to draw two characters for me.\nBoth of them are related to the same character, Rumii Kisaragi, and the character design represents different form of her. Therefore, I would like both of the well designed character to show up in the same artwork.\nThe commission will be used for her fan club celebration events, and I will give the credits to you when tweeting out the artwork.\nThe pose and emotion are up to you.\n\nThank you for your kind consideration.\n\nCharacter A: https://twitter.com/CaTheSicken/status/1439646177448718337/photo/1\nCharacter B: https://twitter.com/CaTheSicken/status/1509892765852717063/photo/1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}